=== mlr-1: multi-column GROUP BY CTE (60000 groups, heavy cross-node-group redistribution), scalar reduce ===
idle level before the first execution: QUERY_MEMORY and TRANSACTION_MEMORY recorded on all 4 data nodes
reference run: 1 execution(s) via RDRS, every result identical to the reference
warm-up: 8 execution(s) via RDRS, 4 concurrent clients, every 200 response identical to the reference
first use: QUERY_MEMORY and TRANSACTION_MEMORY within the first-use allowance on all 4 data nodes
== Query ==
WITH g AS (
SELECT lg_cust AS k, lg_status AS st, SUM(lg_qty) AS q, COUNT(*) AS c
FROM lg_orders GROUP BY lg_cust, lg_status)
SELECT COUNT(*) AS group_count, SUM(q) AS total_qty, SUM(c) AS total_rows
FROM g;

Number of output lines, including header: 2

